    rdfs:comment "Compared the quality of the predictions of the log(Cmax) with three amidine solvents as an external test data, using model obtained. 1,1,3,3-tetramethylguan- idine (TMG), 1,5-diazabicyclo(4.3.0)non-5-ene (DBN) and 1,8-diazabicycloundec-7-ene (DBU) are consider as solvents which are incapable to disperse SWNTs, and correlated result were obtained after apply the built model. Statistical value were provided in the table 2 in the publication which could be understood as cross-validation value but it was not specified in the paper, thus it was considered as not be included in the table."@en ;
