    rdfs:comment "They implement an additional criteria for quality evaluation and also a tool to elucidate underlying structure of nanotoxicity (Mechanistic Interpretation), which was the development of causal structures. For specific details see the publication's Figure 5. The conclusion was the following: In fact, there is no direct link between toxicity and any descriptor. It means there are only particular causal links and the developed models are the collection of the most important descriptors, which only represent the conditions for the emergence of particular cause of action. Correlation between target properties was evaluated via Ï•- coefficient. S_Ï• = 0.51which means that there is an average degree of association between two types of toxicity."@en ;
    skos:narrower [ a mesh:D021281 ;
