    rdfs:comment "The nano-QTTR is not clearly well fitted with the meaning of QSAR, but it is interesting the idea of the model, as they explain, where will be possible to use in vitro data to develop a model of in vivo toxicity, hence reducing the number of experimental work with animals. There is a widespread Mechanistic Interpretation. More statistical results were provided related with Roy et al., 2012, as in a few previous classified papers where we decided to avoid that data since, there is not a good parameter to compare with the rest of classified publication in the table"@en ;
    skos:narrower [ a mesh:D021281 ;
