    rdfs:comment "Prediction rms decreased to 0.34 log units if trichloromethane was removed from the set. Model was developed using standard tests of linear fitness and T-values greater than 4. Descriptors tend to agree with basic solvation principles. Errors indicate a poor predictive model in that the external prediction set rms error was much higher than the training set."@en ;
