<https://h2020-sbd4nano.github.io/sbd-data-landscape/Model_32a/Endpoint> a bao:BAO_0000179 ;
    bao:BAO_0002662 [ a "Photocatalytic decolourization rate constants DRC (10^-5 /s) of methylene blue dye" ] ;
    rdfs:comment "The photocatalytic performance of each sample was tested by dye (methylene blue) decolourisation under simulated solar light illumination (mixture of UV and visible), with regular measurements of the dye concentration (determined by absorbance at 664 nm). (Goodall, 2010) The dye decolourisation rate is defined as d ln[C(t)/C0]/dt, where C0 is the initial dye concentration and C(t) is the dye concentration at time t."@en .

