<https://h2020-sbd4nano.github.io/sbd-data-landscape/Model_60/Endpoint> a bao:BAO_0000179 ;
    bao:BAO_0002662 [ a enm:ENM_9000082 ;
            rdfs:label "Solubility in organic solvents"@en ] ;
    rdfs:comment "Solubilities of C60 in different solvents (Table 1 in the publication , 134 different solvents) were taken from a previous reference. Solubilities are given in terms of logarithmic values of molar fractions (log S) because the log S values correspond to the free energy changes in the solvation process. For some solvents, zero solubility values were reported, hence log S is undeterminable. Then the authors used \"< -8\" notation in the Tables to face this issue."@en .

