  dc:description "This study is applicable for assessing the toxic effects of DBDPE at environmentally relevant concentrations on the reproductive systems of adult male zebrafish and mammals (mouse spermatogonial cells), particularly suitable for toxicity studies at the level of adult males and germ cells."@en ;
