<https://identifiers.org/aop/592> a sbd:Model ;
  rdfs:label "DBDPE-induced DNA strand breaks and LDH activity inhibition leading to population growth rate decline via energy metabolism disrupt and apoptosis"@en ;
  dc:source <https://h2020-sbd4nano.github.io/sbd-data-aopwiki/models/> ;
  dc:description "Maintenance of sustainable fish and wildlife populations (i.e., adequate to ensure long-term delivery of valued ecosystem services) is a widely accepted regulatory goal upon which risk assessments and risk management decisions are based."@en ;
